(403, 1, '2022-01-11 10:42:51', '2022-01-11 10:42:51', '<p>Web development is the work involved in developing a website for the Internet or an intranet. Web development can range from developing a simple single static page of plain text to complex web applications, electronic businesses, and social network services.</p><p>Donec fermentum aliquam sem, ultricies egestas sem tincidunt non. Morbi lobortis est consectetur vitae turpis molestie sodales. Nunc commodo enim ut elit egestas luctus. Cras ut lacus quis erat molestie lacinia. Donec fermentum aliquam sem, ultricies egestas sem tincidunt non. Morbi lobortis est consectetur neque pulvinar, sed fringilla lacus tincidunt. Praesent pulvinar quis turpis vitae feugiat. Curabitur dapibus et justo ac vulputate. Morbi turpis arcu, eleifend sit amet tincidunt vel, molestie a augue. Pellentesque fermentum eros sed augue ornare feugiat. Mauris gravida enim mollis velit molestie, quis mattis metus dapibus. Cras efficitur cursus vehicula.</p><p>Sed pretium rhoncus lobortis. Etiam convallis et elit vel pretium. Maecenas hendrerit suscipit tincidunt. Praesent porta est sed diam accumsan finibus. Aliquam erat volutpat. Curabitur ac egestas nibh, vel malesuada orci. Aliquam eleifend lobortis ultrices. Sed blandit leo metus, at facilisis nibh efficitur quis. Fusce in venenatis elit, eu eleifend ligula. Class aptent taciti sociosqu ad litora torquent per conubia nostra, per inceptos himenaeos.</p><p>Nunc mollis nisi vel neque imperdiet dignissim. Curabitur ullamcorper mollis facilisis. Integer quis felis vitae felis interdum efficitur. Sed dignissim scelerisque elementum. Donec mi ligula, elementum eget tempus sed, mollis sit amet diam. Donec porta accumsan varius. Vivamus condimentum ultrices augue eu commodo. Nunc felis metus, scelerisque egestas pulvinar eget, ultricies eget dui. Nullam in enim ut mi eleifend sollicitudin efficitur ut ipsum.</p>', 'Getting Started with JavaScript', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'getting-started-with-javascript', '', '', '2026-03-22 21:31:50', '2026-03-23 00:31:50', '', 399, 'https://chandani-spacious-ecademy.sites.qsandbox.com/lesson/getting-started-with-javascript/', 1, 'mto-lesson', '', 0),
(404, 1, '2022-01-11 10:43:37', '2022-01-11 10:43:37', '<p><strong>React</strong> (also known as <strong>React.js</strong> or <strong>ReactJS</strong>) is a <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Free_and_open-source_software\">free and open-source</a> <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Front_end_and_back_end\">front-end</a> <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/JavaScript_library\">JavaScript library</a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/React_(JavaScript_library)#cite_note-react-3\">[3]</a> for building <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/User_interfaces\">user interfaces</a> based on UI components. It is maintained by <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meta_Platforms\">Meta</a> (formerly Facebook) and a community of individual developers and companies.<a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/React_(JavaScript_library)#cite_note-4\">[4]</a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/React_(JavaScript_library)#cite_note-5\">[5]</a><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/React_(JavaScript_library)#cite_note-6\">[6]</a> React can be used as a base in the development of <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Single-page_application\">single-page</a> or mobile applications. However, React is only concerned with state management and rendering that state to the <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Document_Object_Model\">DOM</a>, so creating React applications usually requires the use of additional libraries for routing, as well as certain client-side functionality.</p>', 'React JS quiz', '', 'publish', 'open', 'closed', '', 'react-js-quiz', '', '', '2022-01-11 10:43:37', '2022-01-11 10:43:37', '', 399, 'https://chandani-spacious-ecademy.sites.qsandbox.com/quiz/react-js-quiz/', 2, 'mto-quiz', '', 0),
